#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:126
msgid "Free explore"
msgstr "自由に試す"

#: INSTRUCTIONS.md:128
msgid ""
"Take a protein of interest, or alanine 2, and bias more than one variable. "
"To try CGDS, choose the center of mass of some different parts of your "
"protein. Can you bias the distance between these COMs and the angle between "
"them at the same time? Does using COVAR or LM affect the speed of "
"convergence?"
msgstr ""
"関心のあるタンパク質、または Alanine Dipeptide を用い、複数の変数に Bias を加える。CGDS "
"を試すには、タンパク質のいくつかの部分について Center of Mass を選ぶ。これらの COMs の間の距離と角度に、同時に Bias "
"を加えられるだろうか。COVAR や LM を使うと収束速度は変わるだろうか。"
